305
00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:53.758
A send can only be judged once its deadline has passed.

306
00:19:54.038 --> 00:19:58.859
Resend via another vendor for OTPs when no DLR arrives in time.

307
00:19:59.139 --> 00:20:03.129
It costs a few percent more SMS; a failed login costs far more.

308
00:20:03.409 --> 00:20:07.142
Users can also tap resend or get OTP on WhatsApp.

309
00:20:08.492 --> 00:20:16.087
Routing also optimises cost (the cheapest healthy vendor wins) and respects vendor TPS and per-operator health.

310
00:20:16.367 --> 00:20:26.969
Push has its own failure modes: stale tokens (clean up on UNREGISTERED), OS-level throttling of background pushes, silent drops on some Android OEMs.

311
00:20:27.249 --> 00:20:31.537
That's why critical pushes escalate to SMS if not seen (L4).

